---
import { bodyEffects } from '../data/body-effects.mjs';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';
---
<section class="container body-explorer" aria-labelledby="body-map-title" data-body-explorer>
  <header class="body-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Fragrance &amp; your body</p>
    <h2 id="body-map-title">Where can fragrance affect you?</h2>
    <p>Skin contact and breathing are two ways exposure can happen. Explore possible reactions in sensitive people—not a prediction that everyone will be harmed.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="body-layout">
    <figure class="body-figure">
      <div class="body-canvas">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 420 560" role="img" aria-labelledby="body-illustration-title body-illustration-description">
          <title id="body-illustration-title">Human body: head, eyes, nose, airways and skin</title>
          <desc id="body-illustration-description">A simplified front-facing human silhouette with lungs. Numbered buttons connect each area to its explanation. This is a symptom map, not an anatomical diagnosis.</desc>
          <defs><linearGradient id="body-skin-tone" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#EBD7C4"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#D8BBA5"/></linearGradient></defs>
          <ellipse cx="210" cy="292" rx="154" ry="230" fill="#E8F3F8" opacity=".55"/>
          <circle cx="295" cy="92" r="36" fill="#F4A261" opacity=".12"/>
          <ellipse cx="210" cy="537" rx="82" ry="10" fill="#7A9A8B" opacity=".14"/>
          <g fill="url(#body-skin-tone)" stroke="#BD9E89" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M192 130 L192 157 Q165 158 149 174 Q137 188 129 221 L109 289 L96 348 Q93 365 101 370 Q109 373 114 360 L131 308 L155 246 L157 318 Q150 344 156 376 L171 504 Q172 525 185 527 Q200 528 201 508 L209 384 L211 384 L219 508 Q220 528 235 527 Q248 525 249 504 L264 376 Q270 344 263 318 L265 246 L289 308 L306 360 Q311 373 319 370 Q327 365 324 348 L311 289 L291 221 Q283 188 271 174 Q255 158 228 157 L228 130 Z"/>
            <path d="M210 38 Q176 38 174 80 L175 105 Q177 140 210 147 Q243 140 245 105 L246 80 Q244 38 210 38 Z"/>
          </g>
          <g fill="none" stroke="#8C7566" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M188 99 Q194 95 200 99 M220 99 Q226 95 232 99"/><path d="M210 104 L206 116 L212 117 M201 128 Q210 132 219 128"/></g>
          <g fill="#C6887E" opacity=".8"><path d="M201 188 Q176 185 168 216 Q160 242 170 266 Q183 273 200 257 Z"/><path d="M219 188 Q244 185 252 216 Q260 242 250 266 Q237 273 220 257 Z"/></g>
          <g fill="none" stroke="#FAF5EF" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M210 154 L210 215 M210 210 L185 235 M210 210 L235 235"/></g>
          <g fill="none" stroke="#7A9A8B" stroke-width="1.5" opacity=".75"><path d="M159 73 H87 M230 99 L255 118 H331 M210 116 L180 163 H82 M252 241 H337 M109 325 H63"/></g>
          <g fill="#526A60" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="600"><text x="51" y="69">Head</text><text x="337" y="114">Eyes</text><text x="45" y="159">Nose</text><text x="339" y="237">Airways</text><text x="27" y="321">Skin</text></g>
        </svg>
        {bodyEffects.map((effect, index) => <button class="body-hotspot" type="button" style={`--x:${effect.x}%;--y:${effect.y}%`} data-body-target={effect.id} aria-controls={`body-detail-${effect.id}`} aria-label={`Explore ${effect.label}: ${effect.title}`} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}><span aria-hidden="true">{index + 1}</span></button>)}
      </div>
      <figcaption>Tap a numbered area or open an explanation.<br/>Simplified illustration · not a diagnostic tool</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="body-explanations">
      <p class="body-instruction">Different people. Different responses.</p>
      {bodyEffects.map((effect, index) => <details id={`body-detail-${effect.id}`} data-body-detail={effect.id} open={index === 0}>
        <summary><span class="body-number" aria-hidden="true">{index + 1}</span><span><small>{effect.label}</small>{effect.title}</span><span class="body-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <div class="body-detail-copy"><span class="body-evidence">{effect.evidence}</span><p>{effect.text}</p><a class="text-link" href={effect.source} rel="external">Source: FDA · cosmetic allergens ↗</a></div>
      </details>)}
      <p class="body-care">Severe breathing difficulty or throat swelling needs urgent medical help. Persistent symptoms deserve individual assessment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <details class="body-research">
    <summary><span class="research-badge">Ingredient-specific evidence</span>What about hormones &amp; reproductive health?</summary>
    <div><p>Hormones act throughout the body—not at one “damage spot.” Some chemicals, including certain phthalates, can interfere with hormone signaling. That does not establish that every fragrance causes reproductive harm: the ingredient, exposure and evidence matter.</p><p><a href="https://www.niehs.nih.gov/health/topics/agents/endocrine" rel="external">NIEHS · endocrine disruptors ↗</a> · The <a href="https://www.fda.gov/cosmetics/cosmetic-ingredients/phthalates-cosmetics" rel="external">FDA reports no safety concerns for DEP as currently used in cosmetics and fragrances</a>.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('guides/vocs-and-endocrine-disruptors/')}>Explore the VOCs &amp; endocrine disruptors guide →</a></div>
  </details>
  <p class="body-limit">This illustration does not establish that fragrance causes cancer, autism or ADHD. Natural essential oils can also contain allergens. Sources reviewed October 2026.</p>
  <noscript><p class="body-limit">Open the explanations directly to explore each area; body-marker interactions need JavaScript.</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-body-explorer]').forEach(explorer => {
    const markers = [...explorer.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-body-target]')];
    const explanations = [...explorer.querySelectorAll<HTMLDetailsElement>('[data-body-detail]')];
    function selectArea(id: string) {
      explanations.forEach(detail => { detail.open = detail.dataset.bodyDetail === id; });
      markers.forEach(marker => marker.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(marker.dataset.bodyTarget === id)));
    }
    markers.forEach(marker => marker.addEventListener('click', () => {
      selectArea(marker.dataset.bodyTarget!);
      const summary = explanations.find(detail => detail.dataset.bodyDetail === marker.dataset.bodyTarget)?.querySelector('summary');
      summary?.focus({ preventScroll: true });
      if (window.matchMedia('(max-width:760px)').matches) summary?.scrollIntoView({ block: 'center', behavior: 'auto' });
    }));
    explanations.forEach(detail => detail.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
      markers.find(marker => marker.dataset.bodyTarget === detail.dataset.bodyDetail)?.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(detail.open));
    }));
  });
</script>
<style>
  .body-explorer{margin-block:12px 44px;padding:30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:var(--card)}
  .body-heading h2{font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,38px);letter-spacing:-1px;line-height:1.2;margin:8px 0 12px}
  .body-heading>p:last-child{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;max-width:780px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:20px}
  .body-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.85fr) minmax(0,1.15fr);gap:32px;align-items:center}
  .body-figure{margin:0;border-radius:20px;background:var(--canvas);padding:12px 12px 18px}
  .body-canvas{position:relative;width:min(100%,390px);margin:auto;aspect-ratio:420/560}
  .body-canvas svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}
  .body-hotspot{position:absolute;left:var(--x);top:var(--y);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:44px;min-height:44px;padding:0;border:2px solid #fff;border-radius:999px;background:#F8DBC3;color:#49372C;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #C8956C;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;transition:background .2s,box-shadow .2s}
  .body-hotspot:is(:hover,[aria-pressed='true']){background:var(--accent-active);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px #f4a26126}
  .body-hotspot:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #526A60;outline-offset:5px}
  .body-figure figcaption{text-align:center;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}
  .body-instruction{font-size:12px;color:#526A60;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px}
  .body-explanations details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .body-explanations summary{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;list-style:none;padding:15px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4}
  summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .body-number{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 32px;height:32px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-sky);color:#526A60;font-size:12px}
  .body-explanations summary small{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:3px}
  .body-plus{margin-left:auto;color:#526A60;font-size:22px;font-weight:400}
  details[open] .body-plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .body-detail-copy{padding:0 0 18px 44px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
  .body-detail-copy p{color:var(--muted);margin:10px 0}
  .body-detail-copy .text-link{font-size:11px}
  .body-evidence{font-size:10px;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-sky);color:#435E52;display:inline-block}
  .body-care{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 0;margin:8px 0 0}
  .body-research{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--canvas);padding:16px 20px;margin-top:22px}
  .body-research summary{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;list-style:none;line-height:1.5}
  .body-research summary::after{content:'+';margin-left:auto;font-size:20px;font-weight:400}
  .body-research[open] summary::after{content:'−'}
  .research-badge{background:#F8DBC3;color:#624936;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap}
  .body-research>div{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;max-width:920px}
  .body-research a{color:#435E52;font-weight:600}
  .body-limit{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:16px 0 0}
  @media(max-width:760px){.body-explorer{padding:22px 18px}.body-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.body-canvas{width:min(100%,320px)}.body-heading h2{font-size:28px}.body-detail-copy{padding-left:0}.body-explanations summary{font-size:14px}.body-research{padding:14px}.body-research summary{font-size:13px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.body-hotspot{transition:none}}
</style>
